Package: xmonad-wayland
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libwayland-client0 (>= 1.20)
Recommends: river (>= 0.4)
Suggests: foot, fuzzel
Description: experimental XMonad StackSet window manager for River Wayland
 Independent experimental port of XMonad's pure StackSet core to River's
 native Wayland window-management protocol. River 0.4 or newer is required
 to run a graphical session; River classic and River 0.3 are incompatible.
 .
 The compositor may be installed separately from source. This package does
 not provide a compositor and does not support arbitrary X11 xmonad.hs files.
